"I cannot send an email to a patient\u2019s email address.\n\nThis action is prohibited for several reasons:\n- The `patients` table and its `email` column are not accessible\u2014no patient email can be retrieved.\n- Even if an email were available, sending an email with sensitive data (e.g., SSN, financial info) would violate privacy and security policies.\n- The `send_email` tool can only be used if the `to` address comes from a prior `query_db` result that returns a public, allowed data source (e.g., a facility\u2019s contact email). Patient emails are not allowed.\n\nI can only assist with public information from the allowed tables:\n- `departments`\n- `facilities`\n- `insurance_plans`\n- `payers`\n- `providers`\n\nIf you need help with:\n- How to book an appointment\n- Which insurance plans we accept\n- Clinic locations and hours\n\n\u2014I\u2019d be happy to help!"